hadiths[52]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Abul Abbas Ahmad bin Muhammad bin Isa al-Qadi al-Barti ne kaha: san 342 Hijri, Zulhijjah ke mahine mein, Dar Qatn ki masjid mein, Abu Sahl Ahmad bin Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Ziyad al-Qattan ne hamein hadis bayan ki, is tarah ke un par parha ja raha tha aur main sun raha tha. Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) Sham ki taraf nikle. Jab Sargh naami maqam par pahunche to unhein lashkar ke amir Abu Ubaidah aur un ke sathi mile. Unhon ne aap ko bataya ke Sham mein waba phail chuki hai. Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: ""Mere paas pehle Muhajirin ko bulao."" Aap ne unhein bula kar un se mashwara talab kiya aur unhein bataya ke Sham mein waba phail chuki hai to unhon ne is par ikhtilaf kiya; baaz ne kaha ke aap ek aise kaam ke liye nikle hain jis se wapsi hum achhi nahin samajhte. [Jabke] baaz ne kaha ke aap ke sathi baqi manda log aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) hain to hum achha nahin samajhte ke aap unhein bimari wali jagah par le jayein. Phir kaha ke mere paas Ansar ko bulao; unhon ne Ansar ko bulaya to aap ne un se bhi mashwara talab kiya; to unhon ne bhi Muhajirin wala rasta ikhtiyar kiya aur ikhtilaf-e-raay kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Theek hai aap log chale jao; phir kaha ke yahan Fath-e-Makkah ke Muhajirin Quraish ke jo shuyukh [boorhe aadmi] maujud hain unhein bulao; un mein se do aadmiyon ne kaha: hamara khayal hai ke aap logon ko wapas le jayein aur waba wali jagah par na le jayein to Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne logon mein wapas jane ka elan kar diya. Abu Ubaidah bin al-Jarrah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Kya Allah Ta'ala ki taqdir se farar hasil karoge? To Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ay Abu Ubaidah, kaash tum ye baat na kehte. Ji haan! Hum Allah ki taqdir se bhaag rahe hain lekin Allah Azza wa Jalla ki taqdir ki taraf hi ja rahe hain. Aap ka kya khayal hai agar aap ka oont kisi aisi wadi mein utre jis ke do kinare hon: ek sarsabz aur dusra khushk banjar, aur tum sarsabz kinare mein use charao ge to kya ye Allah Ta'ala ki taqdir nahin? [Itne mein] Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) tashreef le aaye aur woh kisi kaam ki gharz se aaye the. Unhon ne hadis bayan ki ke ek din hamare paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tashreef laye to aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne hath se ishara kar ke farmaya: 'Ye Rabbul Aalameen ki taraf se ek Kitab hai jis mein Jannat walon ke naam, un ke baapon ke naam aur un ke qabeelon [ke naam] hain, awwal se aakhir tak. [Ab] na is mein kuch izafa ho sakta hai na kami. Aur ye Rabbul Aalameen ki taraf se [ek] Kitab hai jis mein Jahannam walon ke naam, un ke baapon ke naam aur un ke qabeelon [ke naam] hain, awwal se aakhir tak. Na is mein kuch izafa ho sakta hai na kami. Allah Ta'ala in umoor se farigh ho chuka. Ek girooh Jannat mein aur ek Jahannam mein. Jo Jannat walon mein se hai, us ka anjam Jannat walon ke aamal par hoga, chahe us ne har qism ke aamal kiye hon. Aur jo Jahannam walon mein se hai, us ka anjam Jahannam walon ke sath hoga, chahe us ne har qism ke aamal kiye hon.'"
"2","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne bayan kiya ke jab Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Sham se wapas aaye to main un ke paas gaya; woh apne kheme mein qailula kar rahe the. Maine kheme ke bahar un ka intezar kiya; jab aap apni neend se bedar hue to maine unhein ye alfaz kehte suna: Ay Allah! ""Sargh"" se wapas aane ki ghalti ki wajah se mujhe muaf farma dena."
"3","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya ke Sayyiduna Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadis ko [madde nazar] rakhte hue logon ko wapas le gaye."
"4","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se marwi hai; unhon ne kaha ke main Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath namaz ke bare mein muzakira kar raha tha; achanak hamare paas Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) tashreef laye aur farmaya: ""Kya main tumhein aisi baat na bataun jo maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni hai? Hum ne kaha: Kyun nahin. Unhon ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ye farmate hue suna: Jab tum mein se koi shakhs namaz parh raha ho aur use rakaat kam parhne ka shak par jaye to woh namaz parhta rahe hatta ke use ziyadti ka yaqin ho jaye, yani use yaqin ho jaye ke zyada rakaat ho gayi hain."""
"5","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabi'ah ne bayan kiya; kaha ke Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ko [safar-e-Makkah mein] [oonton ko haddi ba-aawaz-e-buland haankte] suna, to raat ke kisi hisse mein un ke sath Makkah dakhil hue; jab subah hui to unhein moze pehne dekha, to farmaya: Aap ne moze pehan rakhe hain? Unhon ne kaha: Maine aisi shakhsiyat ki maujudagi mein unhein pehna jo aap se behtar the, yani Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam)."
"6","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amir bin Rabi'ah aur Salim bin Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) donon ne bayan kiya ke Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ki hadis ki wajah se logon ko ""Sargh"" se wapas hata liya; jab Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) laut aaye to lashkaron ke aamileen apne kaamon ki taraf laut gaye."
"7","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya; kaha ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) Madinah tashreef laye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke darmiyan aur Sa'd bin al-Rabi' al-Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) ke darmiyan rishta-e-ukhuwwat qaim kiya. Hazrat Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas do biwiyan thin; unhon ne unhein peshkash ki ke woh un ke ghar baar aur maal se aadha hissa baant lein [yani ek biwi aur aadha maal] le lein. Chunache Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Allah Ta'ala aap ke ahl-o-maal mein barkat de; mujhe bazaar ki raah dikha dein. Agle din woh bazaar gaye aur paneer aur ghee mein kuch nafa kamaya; phir ek din unhein Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dekha ke un par hijla-e-aroosi ke nishanat the. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne daryaft farmaya: ""Ay Abdur Rahman kya muamla hai?"" Unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Maine Ansar ki ek aurat ke sath shadi kar li hai. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kaha: ""Use kitna mahr pesh kiya?"" Unhon ne kaha: Khajoor ki guthli ke barabar sona. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Walima karo agarche ek bakri hi kyun na ho."""
"8","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) Madinah aaye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke aur Sa'd bin al-Rabi' al-Ansari ke darmiyan bhai chara qaim kiya. Hazrat Sa'd ke paas do biwiyan thin, to unhon ne peshkash ki ke mere ghar baar aur maal se aadha baant lein, magar Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman ne kaha: Allah Ta'ala aap ke ahl-o-maal mein barkat de; aap meri bazaar ki taraf rahnumai kar dein. Aap ne bazaar mein aa kar paneer aur ghee se bahut nafa kamaya. Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein kuch dinon baad dekha to un par zard nishanat the. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne daryaft farmaya: ""Abdur Rahman kya muamla hai?"" Unhon ne arz kiya: Ay Allah ke Rasul! Maine Ansar ki ek aurat ke sath shadi kar li hai. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""To ne use kya mahr diya?"" Unhon ne kaha ke khajoor ki guthli ke barabar sona; to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Walima karo agarche ek bakri hi kyun na ho."""
"9","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya; kaha ke Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) Madinah mein tashreef laye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke aur Sa'd bin al-Rabi' al-Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) ke darmiyan rishta-e-ukhuwwat qaim kar diya. Unhein Sayyiduna Sa'd al-Ansari ne kaha: Ay mere bhai! Main Madine walon mein se zyada maal wala hun. Mere maal se aadha maal le lein aur mere paas do biwiyan hain; jo aap ko zyada pasand lagti hai main use aap ke liye talaq de deta hun [woh iddat guzar le to aap us se shadi kar lein]. Abdur Rahman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala aap ke ahl-o-maal mein barkat de; aap meri mandi ki taraf rahnumai kar dein. To unhon ne mandi ka rasta bata diya; aap mandi mein gaye, khareed-o-farokht ki aur kuch paneer aur ghee kama kar le aaye. Aap is tarah Allah ne jitna chaha kaam karte rahe. [Ek dafa] aap aaye aur aap par hijla-e-aroosi ke nishanat the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein kaha: ""Ye kya hai?"" Unhon ne jawab diya: Ay Allah ke Rasul! Maine ek aurat ke sath shadi kar li hai. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Use kitna haq mahr ada kiya hai?"" Kaha: Khajoor ki guthli ke barabar sona; to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Walima karo agarche ek bakri hi kyun na ho."" To Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Us ke baad aap ne mujhe dekha; agar main pathar uthata to mujhe guman hota ke us ke neeche se maine sona aur chandi uthana hai."
"10","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf aur Zubair bin Awwam (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se juon ki shikayat ki, to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhein ghazwat mein resham ki qameez ki ijazat marhamat farmayi."
"11","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Miswar bin Makhramah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya; kaha: Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: Kya hum par nazil karda aayat mein se ye aayat nahin hai: ""Tum ne jis tarah pehle jihad kiya ab bhi kiya karo."" To unhon ne kaha: Haan ye aayat hai. Farmaya to mujhe ye aayat Mushaf mein nahin mili. Farmaya ke ye aayat Quran ke mansukhat mein se hai. Unhon ne kaha: Hamein dar hai ke log kafir na ban jayein. Unhon ne kaha: Jo Allah chahe ga ho jaye ga. Unhon ne kaha: Agar log kafir ban jayein ge to woh Banu Fulan ke umara aur Banu Fulan ke wuzara ban jayein ge."
"12","[AI-translation] Hamein Sayyiduna Jubair bin Mut'im (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se bayan kiya; kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Main apne chachon ke sath Hilf al-Mutayyibeen mein hazir hua aur us waqt main bachcha tha aur aaj main ye pasand nahin karta ke mujhe surkh oont diye jayein aur un ke badle mein is [muahide] ko tor dun."""
"13","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Rabi'ah se marwi hai ke Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko tab bataya jab woh Sham ja rahe the ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Is takleef ya bimari ke sath tum se pehle ummaton ko azab diya gaya; jab tum kisi zameen mein is waba ke phail jane ka sun lo to is mein dakhil na ho, aur jab tum kisi jagah par ho aur ye bimari wahan phail jaye to is se na bhago."" Unhon ne kaha: Ke ye hadis sun kar Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) wapas laut aaye."
"14","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya; kaha: Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas resham ki ek qameez thi jise woh apne kapre ke neeche [banyan ke taur par] pehente the. Amir Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un se kaha: Ye kyun pehente ho? To unhon ne kaha: Maine ye qameez aisi shakhsiyat ke paas bhi pehni jo aap se behtar the."
"15","[AI-translation] Janab Abu Salamah ne bayan kiya hai ke un ke walid-e-girami Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman [bin Auf] (Raziyallahu anhu) Abu Raddad ki bimar pursi karne gaye; to Sayyiduna Abu Raddad (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhein kaha: Tumhari qaum mein se tum se barh kar mere sath koi sila rahmi nahin karta. To Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna; Aap Rabb Azza wa Jalla se bayan karte hain ke Rabb Ta'ala ne farmaya: ""Main 'Rahman' hun aur maddah 'rahim' maine apne naam se nikala hai; jis ne use milaya main use milaun ga aur jis ne use tora main use torun ga."""
"16","[AI-translation] Janab Abu Salamah ne riwayat bayan karte hue kaha: Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu), al-Laithi (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas teemardari karne ke liye tashreef le kar gaye; to unhon ne kaha: In mein se behtar aur zyada sila rahmi karne wale Abu Muhammad [yani Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman (Raziyallahu anhu)] hain. Unhon ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko irshad farmate hue suna: ""Tumhare Rabb Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya hai: Main Allah woh zaat hun jis ne sila rahmi ko paida kiya; to jis ne is ko milaya main use milaun ga aur jis ne ise kaata main ise kaat dun ga."""
"17","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu), Abu Raddad al-Laithi (Raziyallahu anhu) ke han teemardari ke liye gaye to unhon ne kaha: Sab se behtar aur zyada sila rahmi karne wale Abu Muhammad hain. [Abdur Rahman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha] Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko irshad farmate hue suna: ""Tumhara Rabb Azza wa Jalla farmata hai: Main Allah woh zaat hun jis ne rahim [yani sila rahmi] ko paida kiya aur is ko apne naam se lafz nikala. Main 'Rahman' hun aur ye 'rahim' hai. To jis ne use milaya main use milaun ga aur jis ne use kaata main use katun ga."""
"18","[AI-translation] Janab Abu Salamah ne bayan kiya; kaha ke Sayyiduna Abu Raddad (Raziyallahu anhu) bimar par gaye; Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) un ki bimar pursi ke liye gaye; to unhon ne kaha: Sab se behtar aur zyada sila rahmi karne wale mere ilm ke mutabiq Abu Muhammad hain. Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ye kehte hue suna: ""Allah Azza wa Jalla ne kaha: Main Allah hun aur Main 'Rahman' hun. Maine sila rahmi ko paida kiya aur us ke liye apne naam se lafz nikala; to jis shakhs ne use milaya main use milaun ga aur jis ne use kaata main use katun ga."""
"19","[AI-translation] Janab Abu Salamah ne apne baap Abdur Rahman se bayan kiya; unhon ne Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya: ""Bila shuba Allah Azza wa Jalla ne Ramazan ke roze farz qarar diye hain aur us ke qiyam ko maine sunnat qarar diya hai; jo shakhs iman-o-yaqin aur neki hasil karne ki khatir is [mahine] ke roze rakhe ga aur qiyam kare ga to ye kaam us ke liye guzashta gunahon ka kaffara ban jaye ga."" Ya jaisa ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya."
"20","[AI-translation] Nazr bin Shaiban al-Haddani ne bayan kiya; kaha: Hum ne Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se kaha: Jo kuch aap ne apne baap se suna hai us mein se Ramazan ke bare mein sab se afzal hadis hamein batayein. Abu Salamah ne kaha: Hamein Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya; unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ramazan ka zikr farmaya to use dusre mahinon par fazilat di, jaisa ke Allah Ta'ala ne use fazilat di hai. Irshad farmaya: ""Bila shuba Ramazan ka mahina aisa mahina hai jis ke roze Allah Ta'ala ne Musalmanon par farz qarar diye hain aur us ka qiyam maine sunnat qarar diya hai; to jis shakhs ne iman ki halat mein aur neki hasil karne ki gharz se us ke roze rakhe aur us ka qiyam kiya to woh apne gunahon se us din ki tarah paak ho jaye ga jis din us ki maan ne use janam diya."""
"21","[AI-translation] Janab Abu Salamah ne apne baap Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya: ""Sadqa kiya karo; pas bila shuba main use aage bhejna chahta hun."" To Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ay Allah ke Rasul! Mere paas chaar hazaar hain. Do hazaar main Allah Azza wa Jalla ko qarz deta hun aur do hazaar apne ahl-o-ayaal ke liye [chhorta hun]. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasul (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya: ""Jo to ne diya hai Allah Ta'ala us mein bhi barkat dale aur jo to ne apne baal bachon ke liye rok rakha hai us mein bhi Allah Ta'ala barkat dale."" [Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu)] ne kaha: Ansar mein se ek aadmi aaya aur us ne kaha: Ay Allah ke Rasul! Ek sa' main apne Rabb Azza wa Jalla ko qarz deta hun aur ek sa' apne ahl-o-ayaal ke liye rakhta hun. Pas is mein munafiqon ne aib joi ki aur mazeed kaha: Allah ki qasam! Ibn Auf ne mehaz riyakari ke liye diya hai. To unhon ne kaha ke kya Allah Ta'ala aur us ka Rasul us ke is sa' se be parwah nahin? To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne ye aayat nazil ki: ""Jo log un Momineen ki aib joi karte hain jo apni khushi se sadqa-o-khairat karte hain aur un Momineen ke sadqe ka bhi mazaq urate hain jin ke paas apni mehnat ki kamai ke ilawa sadqa karne ke liye aur kuch nahin hota, Allah un ka mazaq uraye, aur un ke liye dardnaak azab hai."" [9 - At-Taubah: 79]."
"22","[AI-translation] Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ne bayan kiya; unhon ne kaha ke Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Sham ki taraf rawana hue aur un ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba (Raziyallahu anhum) bhi nikle; to wahan Abu Ubaidah bin Jarrah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un ka isteqbal kiya aur woh us waqt Sham ke governor the. Unhon ne Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kaha: Ke aap wapas chale jayein; mere paas Jahannam ki chinghar aur jala dene wali tapish hai. Aap ne kaha: Main wapas nahin lautne wala; ye aisi halat hai jis ko Allah Ta'ala ne likh diya hai. Hum na is se aage ja sakte hain aur na peeche hat sakte hain. To unhon ne kaha: Aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ko zaroor wapas le jayein warna main apni qameez phaar dun ga. To Aap ne farmaya: Main aisa nahin karne wala. To Abdur Rahman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko irshad farmate hue suna: ""Jab tum kisi zameen mein is bimari ke phail jane ka sun lo to us ki taraf mat jao."" Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Ay Abu Muhammad! Kya to ne ye Allah ke Rasul se suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji haan! To Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) sun kar wapas laut aaye aur un ke sath log bhi wapas laut aaye."
"23","[AI-translation] Janab Ibrahim ne apne baap Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat bayan ki. Kaha: Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) par ghashi tari ho gayi to log un par cheekhne lage; jab unhein ifaqa hua to pucha: Kya mujh par ghashi tari ho gayi thi? To logon ne kaha: Ji haan. Unhon ne farmaya: Mere paas do sakht dil aur badmizaj aadmi ya do farishte aaye; woh mujhe le kar ja rahe the; to unhein do aadmi ya farishte mile jo narm aur raham dil the. Unhon ne kaha ke use kahan le kar ja rahe ho? To unhon ne kaha: Aziz al-Amin ya Amir ke paas [qazi ko shak para hai ke Aziz al-Amin ke alfaz hain ya Amir ka lafz bola hai]. Unhon ne kaha: Ke us ko chhor do kyunke ye un logon mein se hai jin ke liye shikam-e-madar se hi saadat likh di gayi hai."
"24","[AI-translation] Janab Ibrahim ne apne baap Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya; unhon ne kaha: Main jang-e-Badr ke din saf mein khara tha; maine apne dayein bayein nazar daurayi to do nau umr Ansari larke khare the; halanke meri khwahish thi ke main kareel jawanon ke darmiyan hun ga [unhein dekh kar main mutmain na hua]. Achanak un donon mein se ek ne mujhe kohni ki zarb lagayi aur kaha: Chacha jaan! Aap Abu Jahl ko jante hain? Maine kaha: Haan, lekin bhatije! To use dekh kar kya kare ga? Us ne kaha: Mujhe pata chala hai ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko galiyan deta hai. Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Agar main us ko dekh lun to mera jism us ke wajud se juda nahin ho ga hatta ke hum mein se ek mar jaye. Us ki baat ko sun kar mutaajjib hua. Itne mein dusre ne bhi mujhe mutawajjah kiya aur isi tarah kaha. Usi lamhe achanak maine Abu Jahl ko dekha; woh apne lashkaron mein bhaga bhaga phir raha tha. Maine un donon se kaha: Ye hai woh aap ka shikar jis ke bare mein tum mujh se sawal kar rahe the. Woh donon apni talwaren le kar hawa ho gaye; jate hi us ka tiya paancha kar diya. Phir bhagte hue Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hue aur [us ke qatl] ki khabar di; to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne pucha: ""Tum mein se kis ne use qatl kiya hai?"" Har ek ne kaha: Maine qatl kiya hai. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum ne apni talwaren saaf kar li hain?"" Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne donon ki talwaren dekhin to farmaya: ""Tum donon ne qatl kiya hai."" Lekin phir Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abu Jahl ka saaz-o-saman Amr bin Jamuh ke bete Muaz ko diya. Ye donon naujawan Muaz bin Afra aur Muaz bin Amr bin al-Jamuh the."
"25","[AI-translation] Sa'd ne apne baap Ibrahim se riwayat kiya; unhon ne Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya; kaha: Umayyah bin Khalaf ne kaha: Ay Abdul Ilah! Tum mein se kaun hai? Jis ke seene par shutar murgh ke par ka nishan hai? Maine kaha: Hamzah bin Abdul Muttalib (Raziyallahu anhu). Us ne kaha: Ye to woh shakhs hai jis ne hamara ye haal kiya hai."
"26","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne bayan kiya; woh apne baap se riwayat karte hain woh apne dada se. Unhon ne kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas ek din khana rakha gaya; unhon ne kaha: Mus'ab bin Umair (Raziyallahu anhu) shaheed hue. Woh mujh se behtar the aur hamare paas ek chadar ke ilawa koi cheez nahin thi jis se unhein kafan diya jata. Aur Hamzah (Raziyallahu anhu) bhi shaheed hue to kafan ke liye ek chadar ke ilawa koi cheez maujud nahin thi. [Raawi ko] shak lahiq hua ke Hamzah (Raziyallahu anhu) ka naam liya ya kisi aur aadmi ke bare mein kaha ke woh mujh se behtar the. Hamare paas kafan ke liye ek chadar ke ilawa aur koi cheez nahin thi. Farmaya: Main [Allah Ta'ala se] darta hun kahin hamein pakeeza cheezein duniya ki zindagi mein hi na de di jayein [aur aakhirat mein hamare liye kuch bhi na ho]. Phir woh rone lage."
"27","[AI-translation] Humaid ne apne walid Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat ki; unhon ne kaha ke: Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Sahaba-e-Kiram (Raziyallahu anhum) ke sath mulk-e-Sham ki taraf rawana hue; jab maqam-e-Sargh par pahunche to unhein Abu Ubaidah (Raziyallahu anhu) aur ahl-e-Sham mile aur aap se kaha: Ay Amirul Momineen! [Sham ki] sarzameen mein bimari phail chuki hai aur aap ke sath ahl as-Sabiqah [hijrat mein sabqat lene wale] aur dusre Sahaba-e-Kiram (Raziyallahu anhum) hain aur agar ye bimari mein [khatm] ho gaye to in jaisa logon mein aur na mile ga. Abu Ubaidah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne aap se kaha: Ay Amirul Momineen! Kya aap maut se bhagein ge? Hamara eetimad-o-taqdir ye hai ke hamein wohi takleef pahunche gi jo Allah Ta'ala ne hamare liye likh di hai. To aap ne farmaya: Mere paas pehle Muhajirin ko bulao. Pas logon ne unhein bula bheja; Aap ne irshad farmaya: Mujhe mashwara do. Chunache un mein se ek jamaat ne kaha: Ay Amirul Momineen! Aap ke sath ahl as-Sabiqah, ahl-e-ilm aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke Sahaba-e-Kiram (Raziyallahu anhum) maujud hain. Aur agar ye bimari mein mubtala ho gaye to logon mein in jaise imandar aur koi nahin hain. Dusri jamaat ne kaha: Ay Amirul Momineen! Kya aap maut se bhagein ge? Hum to Allah Ta'ala ki taqdir par bharosa karte hain. Hamein wohi takleef pahunche gi jo Allah Ta'ala ne hamare muqaddar mein likh di hai. Sab se zyada mukhalifat karne wale Abu Ubaidah (Raziyallahu anhu) the. Aap ne farmaya ke mere paas Ansar ko bulao; chunache unhein bulaya gaya. Aap ne farmaya: Aap log mujhe mashwara do; chunache unhon ne bhi apne Muhajir bhaiyon ki tarah hi baat kahi aur ikhtilaf kiya. Aap ne farmaya: Mere paas Fath-e-Makkah ke Muhajiron ko bulao; Quraish ke bare log aur boorhe aadmi bulao. [Raawi ne] kaha: Unhein bulaya gaya to Aap ne kaha: Mujhe mashwara do. [Raawi ne] kaha: Un mein se do afraad ne ikhtilaf na kiya; unhon ne kaha: Hamare aaba kehte the ke unhein bhi ye takleef lahiq hui thi. Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Log khushki ke raste jayein ge aur unhein maloom nahin ho ga ke kahan woh mutawajjah ho rahe hain. [Raawi ne] kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) tashreef laye aur kaha: Ay Amirul Momineen! Is bare mein mere paas ek hadis hai: Bila shuba Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab tum bimari kisi zameen mein suno to us mein dakhil na ho, aur jab woh [kisi zameen mein] phail jaye to us se bhaag kar mat niklo."" [Raawi ne] kaha: To Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) logon samet wapas laut aaye."
"28","[AI-translation] Hasan ne apne walid Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat bayan ki; woh is riwayat ko Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marfu' bayan karte hain. Ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya: ""Teen cheezein qayamat ke din Arsh ke neeche hon gi. Quran qayamat ke din bandon ki khatir jhagra kare ga; us ka pet bhi ho ga aur pusht bhi. Aur sila rahmi aawaz lagaye gi. Khabardar! Jis ne mujhe milaya use Allah Ta'ala milaye ga aur jis ne mujhe kaata Allah Ta'ala use kaate ga. Aur amanat."""
"29","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr (Raziyallahu anhu) waghera ne Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se bayan kiya; unhon ne kaha ke Umayyah bin Khalaf Makkah mein mera dost tha aur daur-e-jahiliyat mein mera naam Abd Amr tha; jab main Musalman hua to apna naam tabdeel kar ke Abdur Rahman rakh liya. Woh mujhe Makkah mein milta to mujhe kehta: Kya to us naam ko achha nahin janta jo tere walidain ne tera rakha tha? Main kehta: Ji haan. To woh kehta: Pas main Abdur Rahman ko nahin janta. Bas mujhe koi khaas naam bata do jis se main tujhe pukara karun. Pata nahin ke tujhe kya hai ke tera naam Abd Amr pukaron to tu mujhe jawab hi nahin deta, aur mujhe bhi koi musibat nahin aan pari ke main tujhe aise naam se pukaron jise main pehchanta hi nahin? Farmate hain: Maine kaha: Ay Abu Ali! Jo to chahta hai woh rakh le. Us ne kaha: Main tujhe 'Abdul Ilah' keh ke pukara karun ga [yani us ne aap ka naam 'Abdul Ilah' rakh diya]. Ghazwa-e-Badr ke din main us ke qareeb se guzra; us waqt woh apne bete Ali ka hath pakre khara tha. Aur mere paas kuch zirehin thin jinhein maine kafiron se chheena tha. Jab us ne mujhe dekha to kaha: Ay Abd Amr! Maine koi jawab na diya. Us ne kaha: Ay Abdul Ilah! Maine kaha: Ji haan. Us ne kaha: Main tumhare liye in zirehon se zyada behtar hun. Maine kaha: Haan. To maine apne hath se zirehein phenk din aur us ka aur us ke bete ka hath pakar liya."
"30","[AI-translation] Janab Urwah bin Zubair se riwayat hai; woh Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se bayan karte hain; unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se pucha: ""Tum ne Hajar-e-Aswad ke chhune ke bare mein kaise kiya?"" Maine arz kiya: Maine kabhi chhu liya aur kabhi chhor diya. Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""To ne theek kiya."""
"31","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Zubair se riwayat hai; unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se pucha: ""Tum ne Hajar-e-Aswad ke chhune ke bare mein kaise kiya?"" Unhon ne arz kiya: Maine use kabhi chhua aur kabhi chhor diya; to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""To ne theek kiya."""
"32","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Zubair ne bayan kiya ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se pucha: ""Tum ne [Hajar-e-Aswad] chhune ke bare mein kaise kiya?"" Unhon ne kaha: Maine kabhi use chhu liya aur kabhi chhor diya. Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""To ne theek kiya."""
"33","[AI-translation] Janab Ja'far ne apne baap Muhammad se bayan kiya; unhon ne kaha: Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se Majusiyon ke bare mein pucha [ke un ke sath kya muamla kiya jaye?] To unhon ne farmaya: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Un se Ahl-e-Kitab wala muamla karo."""
"34","[AI-translation] Janab Ja'far apne baap Muhammad se riwayat karte hain ke Sayyiduna Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Majus ka zikr kiya aur kaha: Mujhe maloom nahin ke un ke sath kya muamla karun? Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhein kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ye farmate hue suna: ""Un ke sath wohi sulook karo jo Ahl-e-Kitab ke sath karte ho."""
"35","[AI-translation] Ja'far apne baap Muhammad se bayan karte hain; unhon ne kaha: Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) mimbar aur qabr-e-athar ke darmiyan wali jagah par baithe hue the aur keh rahe the: Mujhe maloom nahin ke main Majus ke sath kya muamla karun? Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Un ke bare mein wohi tariqa apnao jo Ahl-e-Kitab ke bare mein apnate ho."""
"36","[AI-translation] Bajalah ne Abu Sha'sa aur Amr bin Aus Thaqafi ko bayan karte hue suna; aur ye us saal ka waqia hai jis saal Mus'ab bin Umair (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Basrah walon ke sath Hajj kiya, yani san sattar Hijri mein. Aap Zamzam ki seerhi par baithe hue the. Kehte hain un dinon mein Juz' bin Muawiyah, Ahnaf bin Qais ke chacha ka katib tha. To Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ki wafat se ek saal qabl un ka khat aaya ke har jadugar aur kahin ko qatl kar do aur jis Majusi ne apni mahram aurat ko biwi banaya ho to un ke darmiyan judai daal do aur zamzamah se unhein roko. Kehte hain ke kaha: Hum ne teen jadugaron ko qatl kiya aur har Majusi aadmi aur Kitabullah ke mutabiq us ki zi mahram biwi ke darmiyan judai daali. Aur Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Majusiyon se jizya nahin liya tha; lekin jab Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne gawahi di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajar ke Farsiyon se jizya liya tha, [to woh bhi lene lage the]."
"37","[AI-translation] Janab Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Qariz ne bayan kiya ke woh Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas bimar pursi ke liye aaye. Woh us waqt bimar the to [Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne] unhein kaha: Tujhe sila rahmi ka amal milaye. Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ye farmate hue suna: ""Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Main 'Rahman' hun aur 'rahim' mujh se hai; maine use apne naam se nikala hai. Jo use milaye ga main use milaun ga aur jo use kaate ga main use kaat dalun ga."""
"38","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Qariz riwayat karte hain ke woh Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ki bimar pursi ke liye un ke paas tashreef le gaye. Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhein kaha: Sila rahmi tujhe milaye. Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Allah Azza wa Jalla ne farmaya: Main 'Rahman' hun aur 'rahim' ko maine apne naam se nikala hai; jis ne use milaya, main use milaun ga aur jis ne use kaata main use katun ga."" Ya [ye alfaz istemal kiye] ""Jo use kaate ga main use katun ga""."
"39","[AI-translation] Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf al-Qurashi (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain; Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Teen cheezein qayamat ke din Arsh ke neeche hon gi: [ek] Quran aur [dusre] sila rahmi aawaz de gi. Khabardar! Jis ne mujhe milaya Allah use milaye ga aur jis ne mujhe kaata Allah use kaat dale ga."""
"40","[AI-translation] Janab Abu Abdur Rahman riwayat karte hain ke woh Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas baithe hue the; achanak Sayyiduna Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) ka guzar hua. Unhon ne Bilal (Raziyallahu anhu) ko bulaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke wuzu ke bare mein istefsar kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qaza-e-hajat ke liye aate to mujhe bulate; main un ke paas pani lata to Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne amamah aur mozon par masah farmate."
"41","[AI-translation] Falasteen ke kisi qissa go shakhs ne bayan kiya; kaha ke maine Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kehte hue suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya: ""Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Main halaf utha ke kehta hun: Maal sadqa karne se kam nahin hota; lihaza sadqa kiya karo. Agar koi aadmi zulm ke badle muaf kar deta hai to Allah Ta'ala qayamat ke din use izzat mein bulandi de ga, basharteke Allah Ta'ala ki razamandi matloob ho. Aur agar koi aadmi bheek mangna shuru kar de to Allah Ta'ala us par faqiri ka darwaza khol deta hai."""
"42","[AI-translation] Falasteen ke kisi qissa go shakhs ne bayan kiya; kaha ke Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne bayan kiya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna; Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farma rahe the: ""Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki jaan hai; agar in cheezon par main halaf uthaun [to meri baat durust hai]: Sadqa karne se maal kam nahin hota; agar koi aadmi mehaz Allah Rabb al-Izzat ki razamandi ki khatir kisi zulm ke badle darguzar karta hai to Allah Ta'ala qayamat ke din us ki izzat buland kare ga; aur agar koi aadmi bheek mangna shuru kar deta hai to Allah Ta'ala us par faqr ka darwaza khol deta hai."""
"43","[AI-translation] Ghair maroof shakhs ne Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat kiya; kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya: ""Aarab tum par tumhari Isha ki namaz ke naam par ghalba hasil na kar jayein. Oonton wale [Isha ke waqt der se] oontniyon ka doodh dohte hain [aur woh is namaz ko Atamah kehte hain; kahin woh log yahi naam mashhoor na kar dein]."""
"44","[AI-translation] Ahl-e-Taif ke Ghailan naami boorhe shakhs ne Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat ki; kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya: ""Aarab tum par tumhari namaz ke naam par ghalba hasil na kar jayein; ye Allah Azza wa Jalla ki Kitab mein namaz-e-Isha hai. Us ka naam al-Atamah oontniyon ka doodh Isha ke waqt der se dohne ki wajah se rakha gaya hai."""
"45","[AI-translation] Shaqiq ne bayan kiya; kaha: Ke Sayyiduna Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) aur Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke darmiyan koi ranjish ho gayi; chunache Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un ki taraf paigham bheja: Bila shuba Allah ki qasam! Main Hunain ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko akela chhor kar bhaga nahin tha; aur na Badr se peeche raha aur na hi Amir Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ki sunnat ki mukhalifat ki. [Raawi ne] kaha: To Sayyiduna Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) ne un ki taraf paigham bheja ke aap ka ye kehna ke main Hunain ke din bhaag gaya tha to aap ne yaqinan sach kaha; magar [Allah Ta'ala ne] mujhe muaf kar diya tha. Aur jo Amir Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ki sunnat ka muamla hai to Allah ki qasam! Na aap us ki taqat rakhte hain aur na main."
"46","[AI-translation] Sayyidah Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se marwi hai ke un ke paas Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) tashreef laye aur arz kiya: Ay amman jaan! Meri kasrat-e-maal ne mujhe halak kar diya hai. Mere paas ahl-e-Quraish mein sab se zyada maal hai. Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ne farmaya: Ay bete! Sadqa kar do. Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kehte hue suna: ""Mere sahaba mein se aisa bhi ho ga jo mere sath mulaqat kar ke juda ho ga to phir woh mujhe kabhi nahin dekhe ga."" [Raawi ne] kaha: To Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) nikle aur Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se mulaqat ki aur un ko jo Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ne kaha tha woh bataya. To Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hue aur arz kiya: Allah ki qasam! Woh to main hun? Unhon ne farmaya: Nahin! Aur main tumhare baad hargiz kisi ko ye hadis nahin bataun gi."
"47","[AI-translation] Siqah raawi ne bayan kiya ke Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se kisi mareez ki ayadat karne ke liye tashreef le gaye. [Raawi ne bayan kiya] To unhon ne kaha: Main ek kalam zikr karta hun. Unhon ne kaha: Is tarah na kaho balke is tarah kaho jis tarah Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kisi mareez ki ayadat karte waqt duaiya kalimat kehte the: ""Ay Allah! Use jo [bimari] hai use door kar de aur jis aazmaish mein to ne use daala hai us se nijat de."""
"48","[AI-translation] Ek aadmi ne riwayat kiya; kaha ke Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) qissa goi karte the. Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhein kaha: Maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kehte hue suna: ""Qisse amir bayan kar sakta hai ya jise hukm diya jaye ya phir fakhr-o-takabbur karne wala."" [Raawi ne] kaha: Teri maan tujhe gum paye; ye Abdur Rahman bin Auf aisa aisa keh rahe hain. To unhon ne qisse bayan karne ka amal tark kar diya. Phir Muawiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhein qisse bayan karne ka hukm diya to ba-ayn wajah unhon ne qisse bayan karne ko halal samjha."
"49","[AI-translation] Ka'b al-Ahbar qisse bayan karte the. Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: ""Qisse ya to jise hukm diya jaye woh bayan karta hai, ya jo dikhlawa karta hai."" Unhon ne kaha: [yani raawi ne] kaha: Ka'b aaye aur unhein kaha gaya: Teri maan tujhe gum paye; ye to Abdur Rahman bin Auf aisa aisa keh rahe the. Us ke baad unhon ne qisse bayan karne ka amal chhor diya. Phir Muawiyah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne unhein hukm diya to ba-ayn wajah unhon ne [qisson ko bayan karna] halal samjha."
"50","[AI-translation] Zuhri ne bayan kiya; kaha: Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Sham ki taraf nikle; jab Sargh maqam par pahunche, logon ne un ka isteqbal kiya aur zameen waba se bharak chuki thi. Logon ne unhein wapas jane ke liye ishara kiya. Us waqt Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) maujud nahin the. Phir woh aa gaye aur kaha: Main tumhein ek hadis bayan karta hun. Phir unhon ne Usamah ki tarah hadis bayan ki to Amir Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) wapas laut gaye."
"51","[AI-translation] Sha'bi se riwayat hai ke Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko chaar aadmiyon ne qabr-e-mubarak mein utara tha; un mein se aakhri Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) the."
"52","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Zaid ne bayan kiya ke Sayyiduna Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Majus se jizya nahin liya karte the hatta ke Sayyiduna Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ne shahadat di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajar ke Majusiyon se jizya liya tha."
